{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】在北京，國新辦今日(10月14日)舉行記者會，由海關總署介紹今年前三季度進出口情況。另外，為響應政府呼籲市民及早接種流感疫苗，衞生署外展隊到立法會為議員接種流感疫苗。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:03.266518+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:35:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:09.102028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:09.102028+00:00","content_hash":"fe354593f0e95273377f5c78a466d6c78eff1a1578e88eda6f784d365434c34c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}